OL,3,GNEWSATop judge explains decision to
OL,4,Afree murderer who absconded
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's top judge has
OL,7,Fexplained a court's decision to grant
OL,8,Fconvicted killer Gary Anderson
OL,9,Ftemporary release to attend his
OL,10,Ffather's funeral, despite opposition
OL,11,Ffrom prison authorities.
OL,13,FAnderson, 29, who is one of two
OL,14,Fbrothers jailed for life in 2023 for
OL,15,Fthe murder of Karol Kelly in
OL,16,FLondonderry in 2018, failed to return
OL,17,Fto Maghaberry prison on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
