OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATop judge explains decision to
OL,4,Afree murderer who absconded
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prison service had refused to grant
OL,7,FAnderson compassionate temporary
OL,8,Frelease (CTR) to attend the funeral,
OL,9,Fbut that was overturned by a court on
OL,10,FSunday.
OL,12,FThe Office of the Lady Chief Justice
OL,13,F(LCJ) said the court had held that the
OL,14,Fgovernor's decision not to grant CTR
OL,15,Fwas "not substantiated by the evidence
OL,16,Fprovided to the court".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
